msgstr "-"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td:6600-8
msgid "On KOReader start"
msgstr "Bij het starten van KOReader"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:6600-51
msgid ""
"Run this profile every time KOReader starts. Note that this is only possible "
"when KOReader is starting with the <span class=\"ui\">File browser</span> or "
"<span class=\"ui\">Last file</span>."
msgstr ""
"Voer dit profiel uit telkens wanneer KOReader start. Let op: dit is alleen "
"mogelijk als KOReader start met de <span class=\"ui\">Bestandsverkenner</"
"span> of <span class=\"ui\">Laatste bestand</span>."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td:6601-53
