#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7494-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:tip-trackmemusage"
msgid "Keeping an eye on memory usage"
msgstr "Je geheugengebruik in de gaten houden"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7495-6
msgid ""
"In older Kindle devices some of our users reported crashes due to limited "
"memory. KOReader memory usage can go up if you open many files in one "
"session. Especially PDF’s increase this amount. You can add a memory "
"indicator to your <span class=\"ui\">STATUS BAR</span> and restart KOReader "
"if this value gets high, to avoid crashes or reboots."
msgstr ""
"Op oudere Kindle‑apparaten melden sommige gebruikers crashes door beperkt "
"geheugen. Het geheugengebruik van KOReader kan oplopen als je veel bestanden "
"in één sessie opent. Vooral pdf’s verhogen dit. Je kunt een geheugenen "
"indicator toevoegen aan je <span class=\"ui\">STATUSBALK</span> en KOReader "
"herstarten als deze waarde hoog wordt om crashes of reboots te voorkomen."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7497-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status bar / Status bar items / KOReader memory "
"usage"
msgstr ""
"BOVENMENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Statusbalk / KOReader‑geheugengebruik"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7500-6
msgid ""
"Also you can configure KOReader to restart automatically if memory usage "
"reaches a threshold via:"
msgstr ""
"Je kunt KOReader ook automatisch laten herstarten als het geheugengebruik "
"een drempel overschrijdt via:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7501-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Device / Device Status Alerts"
msgstr ""
"BOVENMENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Apparaat / Waarschuwingen apparaatstatus"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7510-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-troubleshooting"
msgid "15 TROUBLESHOOTING"
